{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2022-05-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'EBAY OPENS FIRST-EVER SNEAKER STORE THAT REWARDS SNEAKERHEADS FOR WEARING THEIR KICKS', 'text': "THE WEAR 'EM OUT STORE WILL OFFER EXCLUSIVE PRICING ON COLLECTIBLE KICKS TO THOSE WHO WEAR THEM OUT OF THE STORE LOS ANGELES , MAY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EBAY, KNOWN FOR ITS UNMATCHED INVENTORY OF NEW AND PRE-OWNED SNEAKERS, IS SETTING UP SHOP IN LOS ANGELES WITH A STORE THAT REWARDS SNEAKERHEADS FOR ACTUALLY WEARING THEIR NEW KICKS OUT OF THE STORE. OPEN MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND ON FAIRFAX AVENUE, THE WEAR 'EM OUT STORE WILL FEATURE SOME OF THE MOST EXCLUSIVE AND COVETED SNEAKER STYLES FOR UP TO 70% OFF TODAY'S MARKET PRICE, WITH LOWER PRICES FOR SHOPPERS WHO LITERALLY WEAR THEIR PURCHASES OUT THE DOOR."}